    "text": "12 hours ago Rockdale County Restaurant Report Card – 06/09/2026 The Gwinnett, Newton & Rockdale County Health Departments conducted food service inspections in Rockdale County on 06/09/2026. The following 3 establishments were inspected.\n🔴 Grade U (Failing) = below 70 | 🟠 Grade C = 70–79 | 🟡 Grade B = 80–89 | 🟢 Grade A = 90–100\n🟡 Grade B (80–89) — 1 location\nLa Sabrosita Michoacana — 🟡 82 (Grade B)• Inspected: 06-09-2026 • 1543 Hwy 138 SE Suite F Conyers GA 30013\n🟢 Grade A (90–100) — 2 locations\nDairy Queen — 🟢 92 (Grade A)• Inspected: 06-09-2026 • 1235 DOGWOOD DR Conyers GA 30012Chipotle Mexican Grill — 🟢 100 (Grade A)• Inspected: 06-09-2026 • 2405 Salem Rd SE Conyers GA 30013\nSource: Gwinnett, Newton & Rockdale County Health Departments. Data reflects food service inspections conducted on 06/09/2026.",
